  },
  {
    "id": 4901032160440,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "甜花……\r\n冷蔵庫からミルク、出したら……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103216/4901032160440"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032160450,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "すっごく冷たくって、びっくりして……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103216/4901032160450"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0814",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032160460,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "そしたら、なんか踏んじゃって……\r\n棚からいろんなものも、落ちてきて……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103216/4901032160460"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0997",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3800
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032160470,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ミルクも甘奈と甜花ちゃんの服にかかって、\r\n大変だったんだよね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103216/4901032160470"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032160480,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "でも、千雪さんが『あとで一緒に片づけておくから\r\n大丈夫』って言ってくれて……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103216/4901032160480"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032160490,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "ふふっ、素敵なお洋服だったんだもの\r\nしみになっちゃったら大変でしょう？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103216/4901032160490"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032160500,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "お洋服、ランドリーコーナーでちゃんと洗ったかな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103216/4901032160500"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032160510,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "夜のうちに洗っておいたよ！\r\n心配してくれてありがと、千雪さん！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103216/4901032160510"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00682",
    "fg": "fade_out",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "fgEffectTime": 1000,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032160520,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "あぅ……\r\nほ、ほんとに……ごめんなさい……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103216/4901032160520"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032160530,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "そ、それに……甜花たちが一緒にいれば……\r\n千雪さんのアリバイも、証明できたのに……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103216/4901032160530"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032160540,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "大丈夫",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103216/4901032160540"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032160550,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "クッキーがオーブンの中にいる間、私……\r\nお部屋でお風呂に入ってたりもしてたの",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103216/4901032160550"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032160560,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "10時半に会った時は\r\nパジャマに着替えてたね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103216/4901032160560"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032160570,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "寝る前の甘いものは、いけないけど……\r\nだからこそ、美味しく感じちゃうのよね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103216/4901032160570"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00683",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "大崎甜花さん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "転がったものを踏んでしまったそうですが、\r\nケガなどはありませんでしたか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032160580,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "う、うん……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "special_communications/490103216/4901032160580"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032160590,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "大丈夫……\r\nガムシロップ、だったし……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103216/4901032160590"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032160600,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "踏んじゃって……\r\n飛び散っちゃったけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103216/4901032160600"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "（このキッチン……\r\n夕べはいろいろ大騒動だったんだな……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00432",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032160610,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "クッキーもらいに来た時は、ロビーで他の人を待たせてて\r\nあんまりお礼言えなかったから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103216/4901032160610"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032160620,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "今、こうして来てたんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103216/4901032160620"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "そうだったんですね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00225",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "……しかし、\r\nミルクが異様に冷たかったというのは気になりますね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "こちらの冷凍庫には何も入れていないはずですし……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "冷蔵庫の調子が悪いんでしょうか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0374",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032160630,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "甘奈もそうかな、って思ったんだけど……\r\nさっき調べてみたら、冷えムラとかはなかったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103216/4901032160630"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032160640,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "でも……すっごく、冷たかったよ……\r\n氷より冷たいくらい……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103216/4901032160640"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032160650,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "不思議ね\r\n凍ったものが入ってたわけでもないのに……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103216/4901032160650"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032160660,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うん、ミルクの隣にはコーラのペットボトルが入ってたけど\r\n凍ってなかったのは覚えてる……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103216/4901032160660"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "……ありがとうございます",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "また何か、わからないことがあったら\r\nお話を聞かせていただいてもいいですか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032160670,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "もちろんです！\r\nよろしくお願いしますね……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103216/4901032160670"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00000",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3000
  },
  {
    "label": "end",
    "textFrame": "off"
  }
]